==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bearkini]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Squire Rel]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bearkini might seem intimidating with her fast speed and quick attack rate, but she deals next to no damage and is outranged by most midrangers. Simply kill her with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]]. Many peons will be blocking your way, so you can also use [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] for her Area Attack.

